  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Violence against civilians in NW &amp; SW regions continues to have a serious impact on livelihoods and generate acute humanitarian needs. The Cameroon Joint Response will be implemented by three DRA partners; Stichting Vluchteling, CARE, and PLAN International. The focus will be on Protection (GBV), Health, WASH and FSL.</narrative>
  </description>
