     <actual value="31857">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Awareness raising was also done by community mobilisers on safe and assisted birth, family planning and post abortion care. Sensitisations were done with different groups of people at different places taking into consideration their ages and gender so as to allow freedom of expression and participation. These educations were done in churches, homes, and other public gathering that brought together people from different communities (NW: 9.193/SW: 22.664)</narrative>
      </comment>
