      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="31857">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the SW Region, A total of 22664 persons were reached on awareness raising. 2082 persons in Ekona, 3764 persons in Muyuka, 10298 persons in Mbonge, 2426 persons in Ekombe and 4093 persons at Ekondo Titi.

In the NW region, A total of 9193 persons were reached on awareness raising on Sexual reproductive health and assisted live birth in Mezam and Boyo divisions.

Totally, 31857 persons were reached on awareness raising in the SW and NW Regions of Cameroon.</narrative>
